{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "LEV",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to Moses and to Aaron, saying to them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Speak to the children of Israel, saying, These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the beasts which ye may eat among all the beasts that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whatever parteth the hoof, and is cloven-footed, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cheweth the cud among the beasts, that shall ye eat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, these shall ye not eat, of them that chew the cud, or of them that divide the hoof: the camel, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the coney, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the hare, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof: he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the swine, though he divideth the hoof, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cloven-footed, yet he cheweth not the cud; he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of their flesh shall ye not eat, and their carcass shall ye not touch; they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These shall ye eat, of all that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the waters: whatever hath fins and scales in the waters, in the seas, and in the rivers, them shall ye eat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And all that have not fins nor scales in the seas, and in the rivers, of all that move in the waters, and of any living animal which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the waters, they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination to you:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall be even an abomination to you; ye shall not eat of their flesh, but ye shall have their carcasses in abomination.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whatever hath no fins nor scales in the waters, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are they which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye shall have in abomination among the fowls; they shall not be eaten, they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination: the eagle, and the ossifrage, and the ospray,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the vultur, and the kite after his kind;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every raven after his kind;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the owl, and the night-hawk, and the cuckow, and the hawk after his kind,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the little owl, and the cormorant, and the great owl,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the swan, and the pelican, and the gier-eagle,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the stork, and the heron after her kind, and the lapwing, and the bat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All fowls that creep, going upon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "all",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " four, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet these may ye eat, of every flying creeping animal that goeth upon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "all",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " four, which have legs above their feet, to leap with upon the earth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " these of them ye may eat; the locust after its kind, and the bald locust after its kind, and the beetle after its kind, and the grasshopper after its kind.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " flying creeping animals, which have four feet, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for these ye shall be unclean: whoever toucheth the carcass of them shall be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whoever beareth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "aught",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the carcass of them shall wash his clothes, and be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The carcasses",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of every beast which divideth the hoof, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not cloven-footed, nor cheweth the cud, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you: every one that toucheth them shall be unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whatever goeth upon its paws, among all manner of beasts that go on ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "all",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " four, those ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you: whoever toucheth their carcass shall be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he that beareth the carcass of them shall wash his clothes, and be unclean until the evening: they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you among the creeping animals that creep upon the earth; the weasel, and the mouse, and the tortoise, after its kind,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the ferret and the chameleon, and the lizard, and the snail, and the mole.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you among all that creep: whoever doth touch them, when they are dead, shall be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And upon whatever ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of them, when they are dead, doth fall, it shall be unclean; whether ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " any vessel of wood, or raiment, or skin, or sack, whatever vessel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", in which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " work is done, it must be put into water, and it shall be unclean until the evening; so it shall be cleansed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And every earthen vessel, into which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of them falleth, whatever ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in it shall be unclean; and ye shall break it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of all meat which may be eaten, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "such",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " water cometh shall be unclean: and all drink that may be drank in every ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "such",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vessel, shall be unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And every ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any part",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of their carcass falleth, shall be unclean; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "whether",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an oven, or ranges for pots, they shall be broken down: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean, and shall be unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, a fountain or pit, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in which there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " plenty of water, shall be clean: but that which toucheth their carcass shall be unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any part",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of their carcass shall fall upon any sowing-seed which is to be sown, it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " water shall be put upon the seed, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any part",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of their carcass shall fall on it, it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if any beast, of which ye may eat, shall die; he that toucheth its carcass shall be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he that eateth of its carcass shall wash his clothes, and be unclean until the evening; he also that beareth its carcass shall wash his clothes and be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And every creeping animal that creepeth upon the earth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination; it shall not be eaten.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.11.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.11.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whatever goeth upon the belly, and whatever goeth upon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "all",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " four, or whatever hath more feet among all creeping animals that creep upon the earth, them ye shall not eat; for they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
